	.string "Long ago, it's said that legendary\n"
	.string "POKéMON visited this island.\p"
	.string "The springs became mystical from\n"
	.string "their presence.$"

EightIsland_Text_BeautyMysticSprings::
	.string "You should check out the Mystic\n"
	.string "Springs to the north!\p"
	.string "The scenery is absolutely\n"
	.string "breathtaking!$"
